  "scope": "Dated point checks for three fixed sites and tax parcel overlays for Clifton and Atlanta. Use full project geometry, applicable Letters of Map Change and local records when making a design, coverage or operating decision.",
  "method": "Clifton and Northlake use Census Public_AR_Current street-range geocodes. Atlanta uses the common point in the City of Atlanta’s current address records and their parcel ID. All three points were intersected with FEMA NFHL layer 28. The Clifton and Atlanta county tax parcels were separately matched by situs address or parcel ID. Parcel coverage and Special Flood Hazard Area fractions used intersections in NAD83 / Conus Albers (EPSG:5070), with polygons unioned before area measurement and pieces under 0.01 square metres excluded. FEMA NFHL layer 3 supplied the effective map panels.",
  "source_value_note": "FEMA code -9999 for STATIC_BFE is preserved in the records and indicates no published static base flood elevation in these features.",
